          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "courtney.dickens@stryker.com",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">AXS Universal<sup>® </sup>Aspiration Set<br>\n</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Freedom to choose.</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>The AXS Universal Aspiration Set features next-generation vacuum technology to advance the aspiration of thrombus in the neurovasculature.<br>\n</p>\n",
